# Project Overview

This repository contains the first milestone of a mini data analysis project for the STAT 545 course (Data Analysis with R). The project involves exploring and analyzing a number of datasets, focusing on the Steam Games Dataset, which provides information about game prices, discounts, reviews, and various other attributes related to games available on the Steam platform.

# How to engage with the code

To run the code in this repo, go to the terminal and run

```         
git clone <URL of repo>
```

Open the project in RStudio from the drop-down menu in the top left, and the desired files may be run.

